  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Access to SRH and GBV prevention and response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project seeks to enhance the safety and wellbeing of Syrian refugee women and girls accessing targeted primary health care centers, and empower them to make informed decisions about their sexual and reproductive health.</narrative>
